sequenceDiagram
    participant R0 as Core 0 reader
    participant W0 as Core 0 writer
    participant R1 as Core 1 reader
    participant W1 as Core 1 writer
    participant D as DRAM

    R0->>D: async read tile
    D-->>R0: tile in Core 0 L1
    R0->>W0: push Core 0 CB
    R1->>R1: reserve Core 1 CB
    R1->>W0: increment ready semaphore
    W0->>W0: wait for ready
    W0->>R1: NoC async L1-to-L1 write
    W0->>W0: write barrier
    W0->>R1: increment received semaphore
    R1->>R1: wait, reset, push Core 1 CB
    R1->>W1: tile available
    W1->>D: async write tile
    W1->>W1: barrier and pop CB
